{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56219","headline":"六十甲子歌（题拟） 五十九 · 杜光庭","name":"六十甲子歌（题拟） 五十九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"壬戌中，高低尽不同。\n春夏应遭旱，江南船不通。\n秋冬定有旱，低地好施功。\n高田徒种植，终是见蒿蓬。\n欲知受灾处，扬楚及江东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56219.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56219","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}